# A short tour as a GIF: browse servers, toggle a tool, disable a server, filter.
Output "docs/screenshots/tour.gif"
Source "docs/tapes/config.tape"
Set Framerate 12
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "lazy1mcp" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Down@700ms 4
Sleep 1.5s
Up@700ms 3
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Down@400ms 3
Sleep 600ms
Space
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Down 5
Sleep 800ms
Space
Sleep 2.5s
Type "/"
Sleep 300ms
Type@150ms "doc"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
